window.products.push({"id":603237,"name":"senover Vintage Real Wood Tree Branch Wall Hook Rustic Decorative Wood Adhesive Hooks 3M Coat Key Holder Bag Hat Hook Holder Wall Hooks for Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51159WqspTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Description These Small Tree Branch Wall Hook are very unique holders,Using real branches of different sizes and turning them into hangers.you can use them for keys,  but also they could be used for lightweight jackets,curtains,kitchen towels,pot holders,jewelry,etc.They look like they were cut from a tree,and have different  circumference \"twigs\" for items.besides,they are a lovely organic looking decoration and definitely something different.If you have a nature inspired home, you will love this product! Feature - These are attractive & useful hooks. No more hunting endlessly for keys. - Beautiful natural wood hooks that offer an earthy feel with a very utilitarian purpose. - Strong tackiness to adhere to the wall,perfect for Hanging hats, headphones,coats, jewelry or towels and gadgets,etc - Great for rustic wood themed bedroom bathroom kitchen,a nice rustic and natural decorative product. - The item can work well on the surface of siding,ceramic tile,glass,refrigerators,washing machines and metal - They are about the same height but not the same thickness because it is real nature wood. Package Included: 3 x Adhesive Wall Hooks How to best paste the 3M Hook: Step1: Please choose the spot with care,it's not removable due to its strong stickiness Step2: Please keep the surface dry and dust-free before you pasting the sticker. Step3: Press it properly for 30 seconds and waiting a few hours before using. Step4: Please wait for 24 hours before you place something.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51159WqspTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"senover","source_asin":"B0751BY5VT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0751BY5VT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0751BY5VT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":603238,"name":"CSL Creosote Sweeping Log","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YMn2ZFC8L._AC_.jpg","description":"The CSL Creosote Sweeping Log offers a simple, effective and non-toxic solution for cleaning a chimney, while enjoying a fireplace. It burns like a standard fireplace log, while simultaneously reducing dangerous creosote build-up. A good way to minimize hazards and burn safely throughout the cold months is to use the CSL log intermittently to clean out the flue. The item is a thoughtful accessory for anyone who has a fireplace.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YMn2ZFC8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CSL","source_asin":"B01N2JX1EJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603238","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N2JX1EJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N2JX1EJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":603239,"name":"Hanukkah 8 Disk Set for Cookie Presses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+pq8Ix30L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"► Welcome to Impress! Bakeware. Impress! Bakeware is a small, family-owned company run by two moms who are passionate about spritz cookies! We design adorable, beautiful, whimsical and wonderful cookie press disks for YOU to get creative with! ► We are so excited to be back! We have been busy making changes and are excited to announce that we have added an Impress! Cookie Press to our product line. We have also made some changes to our disks and added some new designs. ► Our new Impress! Cookie Press is a classic press style, featuring lightweight metals with a beautiful high gloss aluminum barrel, so it’s easy to clean and light in your hands. Our top and bottom attaching rings have a smooth, gliding movement for easy assembly, refilling and disk changing. The lever has a smooth motion and is easy to operate. Our Impress! Cookie Press comes with 12 unique disks that are a mix of classic and creative new shapes. ► With over 200 new and unique designs of cookie press disks you can now get creative with your cookie press (or our new Impress! Cookie Press) all year long! See new DISK SIZING information since we have switched from our size M and size P disks to our new ONE SIZE disks. This one size is meant to fit our new Impress! Cookie Press although be sure to check our DISK SIZING information to see what existing presses our new disk size fits. ► Making spritz cookies means no messy floured surfaces like cutout cookies, and pressing cookies is faster and easier than using cookie cutters. Our Impress! Cookie Press Disks allow you to make dozens of new shapes of cookies that are sure to Impress your family and friends. ► Our disks are made with a special 3/32\" thick, highly durable, BPA-free plastic material that create consistent, detailed shaped cookies. ► All of our disks come with a basic Spritz cookie recipe to get you started, as well as decorating ideas and cookie press troubleshooting tips. Happy baking!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+pq8Ix30L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Impress! cookie press disks","source_asin":"B07QJDMJ3F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QJDMJ3F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QJDMJ3F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
