window.products.push({"id":603261,"name":"HOMCOM 7.5 Foot Artificial Christmas Tree, Pine Hinged Xmas Tree with Realistic Branches, Steel Base, Auto Open, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DAdv5D+LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SERIOUSLY NO-HASSLE: If you're looking for a unlit artificial Xmas tree that holds its shape and is a securer option for your family, look no further than this 7.5 ft artificial Christmas tree. No more crowded farms (yech), no more allergies (phew), no fires, no watering, no needles, you get the idea. MAKE FLUFFING FUN: The only time you're really spending is fluffing the tree that has an auto open design, which can be a family-friendly way to decorate and share some hot chocolate, or make it a game: race against the clock, compete to see who fluffs the most, create an obstacle course…the options are nearly endless. MORE AMBIENCE IS BETTER: A flame-retardent realistic Christmas tree is going to give some extra peace-of-mind in case you have to put your tree next to your fireplace. Of course, it's great ambience on its own, but a fireplace...I mean, come on. EASY, EASY, EASY: Here's where the rubber meets the road: you get a slim cardboard box (easy storage). You get several pieces to put together (easy assembly). You get a lightweight and strong base. Even though it's a fake Christmas tree, we've got you covered start to finish. ARTIFICIAL CHRISTMAS TREE INFORMATION: Please note: Only the tree with the stand is included. Ornaments are NOT INCLUDED and are used just for effect. In order to get a full appearance, please spread out all individual tips to get the best possible look from the tree.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DAdv5D+LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMCOM","source_asin":"B0BC85LR5B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC85LR5B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC85LR5B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
