window.products.push({"id":603377,"name":"BONNIU Decorative Throw Pillow Case Cover with Zipper 20X20 Velvet Pillow Sham 50X50 cm Vintage Girl Portrait Art - Modigliani - Woman with Red Hair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CpdBUYhdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WWW*BONNIU*COM is a high-end manufacturing firm specializing in the production of art pillowcases (3D-printed with famous oil paintings). Please contact us!The soft velvet pillow case cover is warm in winter while comfortable in spring, summer and fall. Excellent decor pillowcase for daily decoration, Halloween, Christmas, Easter, Thanksgiving, Valentine day, birthday and other holidays etc. This print art cushion cover is suitable for anywhere indoors such as home, sofa, bed, chair, hammock, couch, bookshelf, living room, bedroom, office, outdoor and indoor decorations. Take these fashionable pillow protector to change your home decor easily while reusing your own pillows. The casual pillow case cover is best gift for anybody, both adults and children, man and woman, boy and girl, toddler and teenager etc. A random pillow sham or loose pillowcase makes a great gift for anyone who enjoys deep, restorative sleep, a perfect gift for her or him!Square pillowcase size: ca. 20X20 inch / 50X50 cm.  Package: 1 pcs pillowcase cover, no insert nor filler. You are strongly recommended to buy several pieces to show as pillow cases set. How to choose a pillow core for this pillowcase? For a luxurious and full looking pillow, please choose inserts that are 1 to 4 inches ( 2.5-10cm ) larger than the pillowcase cover that you'll be using.  Or you can buy smaller pillow filler, if you want it to be able to fluff and conform. How to Install a pillow filler into a pillowcase cover? 1. Open the pillow core package and let it fluffy. 2. Fold the pillow core. 3. Push fit the pillow core into the pillow case cover and close the zipper. 4. Pat evenly the pillow. 5. Completed. gsm=grams per square meter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CpdBUYhdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BONNIU","source_asin":"B08T7ZCMNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T7ZCMNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T7ZCMNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
