window.products.push({"id":603407,"name":"Get Well Soon Gifts for Women Care Package for Women Get Well Gift Basket with Flannel Throw Blankets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H7zIttNgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁💝{Perfect Care Packages for Women} If you're having a difficult time finding the perfect present for friends who are sick or down — look no further. This get well soon gift basket is technically supposed to be a brilliant gift idea. This chic gift box is filled with a few great essentials that women would love, like a soft flannel blanket, a cross necklace with diamond, a hug mug, a scented candle, fuzzy socks, a lavender bath bomb, and a cute message card. 🤞🏻💝{Get Her a Blessed Cross Necklace} The cross necklace for women is a thoughtful way to show friends and family that you're thinking of her. The Cross signifies faith, good luck, and fortune. The cross pendant is believed to protect its wearer from harm, bring calm and peace, and ward off evil spirits. Plus, the design featuring a cross with some diamond makes it incredibly stylish.Perfect for birthday gifts for women. 🤗💝{Luxury Softest Flannel Blanket} The luxury flannel fleece blanket is the perfect way to cozy up and keep warm. With its luxurious soft hand-feel, this blanket makes it a perfect addition to get well soon gifts for women and expresses warmth, comfort, and relaxation. Best choices for thinking of you gifts for women, care package, get well baskets to show encouragement support and care on any occasion as Birthday gifts, Mother's day gifts, Christmas gifts, Thanksgiving gifts, etc. 🥃💝{Impressive Quality Insulated Tumbler} The insulated mug says this mug is a hug from me to you really conveying warm wishes to the recipient. Its insulated interior keeps drinks warm or cold for long periods of time, and it keeps a consistent temperature on the outside too. It definitely won't burn your hand if you have a hot beverage inside, and it won't sweat when you have a cold one. 🛀🏻💝{Soothing SPA Gift Basket for Women} With a scented candle and bath bomb, the recipients are able to have a super soothing and relaxing bath experience. When doing yoga or work, the scented candle can also create an enjoyable atmosphere to relieve stress. After the bath, the fuzzy socks are perfect to get warmth for the feet. The gift box for women includes lovely items intended to help the recipient heal physically and emotionally. ✨💝{Worthwhile and Memorable Gifting Experience} We are on a mission to bring you a fantastic gift-giving experience. Each of the items in the box is made up of premium and 100% safe material. Your satisfaction is always our top priority. If you have any questions, please let us know. Don't hesitate to get this gorgeous care package cuz it's definitely the unique gifts for best friend, sister, daughter, wife, mom, grandmother and co-workers or any other your loved ones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H7zIttNgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yolidas","source_asin":"B0B4968XVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4968XVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4968XVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
