window.products.push({"id":603421,"name":"Stainless Steel Thermal Coffee Carafe Dispenser, Unbreakable Double Wall Vacuum Thermos Flask Large Capacity 56oz 1.6L Water Tea Pot Beverage Pitcher ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KO67zFwrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Retention Temperature：Double-walled 304 food grade stainless steel vacuum insulation with silicone loop allows for maximum temperature retention; keeps your beverage hot up to 12 hours or cold up to 24 hours to preserve flavour and freshness. Premium Quality, Large Capacity：Our coffee thermal carafe adopt 304 food grade stainless steel interior and exterior, Which is durable, reusable, easy to clean, and ideal for home or office.This coffee carafe is capacity of 56 Oz (1.6L) and with Highly Sealed Silicone Loop, always locks in the correct place so it is leakproof. Ergonomic Design：The one-piece plastic handle of pot is easily pressed and lifted to pour water effortlessly.Press-down opening/closing mechanism, Press to Pour and The lid can be removed by rotating it. The one-handed operation is simple and convenient. PP material handle to avoid scald and the V - spout does not splash when pouring water. Versatile Dispenser: Our vacuum thermal carafe is not only perfect used as coffee thermos dispenser, but also as Tea/milk/Juice/Wine carafe, hot water pitcher. Very important tips： After cleaning the pot,please be sure to pre-cool or pre-heat! You need add a small amount of hot water/cold water, Cover and wait about five minutes,pouring out and then infuse hot water/cold water. The best heat preservation result of the product for 80% that full water measure,hold water excessive or lead little, the insulation effect will be affected. In order to prolong the service life of the product, please do not add swellable liquids such as carbonated drinks, and clean it up in time after use. Our thermal carafe vertical inner pot body will not hide water,It is able to empty completely. After washed, there is no watet ihside and no water left in the neck of the pot. Clean and Sanitary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KO67zFwrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yummy Sam","source_asin":"B0C4GGG3DW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603421","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4GGG3DW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4GGG3DW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
