window.products.push({"id":603441,"name":"George Foreman GR18SBTMR Super Champ Grill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NTJBF13ZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Sleek, brushed stainless steel housing From the Manufacturer This 760-watt grill is another variant of the popular George Foreman Lean Mean Fat-Reducing Grilling Machine. Its appeal lies in its simplicity and countertop convenience--not to mention its fat-fighting ability. The double-sided grill has over 50 square inches of non-stick cooking surface to cook burgers, steaks, chicken breasts, sausage, fish, shrimp, or vegetables in minutes. Grill marks not only look appetizing but also contribute caramelized flavor. Patented sloped design allows the deep channels to collect fat, into a safe plastic tray stationed under the unit's front. The grill also has a floating hinge to accommodate foods of varying thickness. Features: Sleek, brushed stainless steel housing Sleek, brushed stainless steel housing Over 50 square inches of cooking surface Over 50 square inches of cooking surface 20 minute timer with automatic beep when food is ready 20 minute timer with automatic beep when food is ready On/Off button On/Off button Non-stick coated grill plate Non-stick coated grill plate Distinctive grill design drains fat Distinctive grill design drains fat Floating hinge accommodate foods of varying thickness Floating hinge accommodate foods of varying thickness Includes drip tray to catch the fat, specially designed spatula, and recipes Includes drip tray to catch the fat, specially designed spatula, and recipes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NTJBF13ZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"George Foreman","source_asin":"B0000U0X2U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000U0X2U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000U0X2U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":603442,"name":"Joy to the World, Christmas Decoration, Authentic Upcycled Artwork, Indoor Outdoor Metal Home Décor, Haitian, 13.5 x 17.5 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HmuBGZrgL._AC_.jpg","description":"Proclaim your holiday spirit with this sign of the season's hope and happiness. Let that starlight shine! In the village of Croix-des-Bouquets, Haiti, the air rings with the sound of metal banging against metal. Workshops line the streets of the village and outside each are stacks of discarded 55-gallon drums awaiting transformation. To begin the process, the tops of the barrels are removed and the open barrel is stuffed with straw and dried banana leaves and then set ablaze. This burns out the residue and old paint and strengthens the metal. After the barrels have cooled, they are slit down the side, pried open, pounded flat and sanded down, giving the artist a smooth flat surface, much like a painter’s canvas. The artist chalks his design onto the metal and then, using a hammer and chisel, begins the work of cutting the sculpture and giving it form, detail and dimension. When he is satisfied with his results, he pounds his signature onto the sculpture and seals it with a protective, weather-proof finish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HmuBGZrgL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"It's Cactus","source_asin":"B00OYAOA76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OYAOA76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OYAOA76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
