window.products.push({"id":603535,"name":"Funny Zoom Meeting Coffee Mug - I Survived Another Meeting That Should Have Been an Email. 15oz Fun Red Tea Cup Christmas Gift Mug For Boss, Employees","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710EyFfstKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕️ Big changes the last couple of years ... and we've survived! We've found new ways to connect, communicate, do business, be with people even when we can’t … :) And just like office meetings of old, some of those meetings should have been an email! Awesome gift for boss, supervisor, co-worker, employees, colleague. ☕️ Your awesome 15oz white and red mug has a large red handle, rim, and inside, for extra cool, color, and class! If we’re going to do these meetings, let’s do them with style. And that reminder on the middle of the mug is there to put a smile on our faces, give us a little motivation, inspiration, and plain old laughs! Perfect gifts for men, women, sister, brother, family, relatives. Even Grandma and Grandpa do Zoom calls now. ☕️ There are all kinds of reasons to love friend or family, fellow workers and survivors of all this! Birthday, anniversary. Heck, a fun housewarming gift, party favor, or just because you want to brighten the day — and many days to come — of those who are important to you. Great office gift for the boss. Mens birthday gift or a gift for women. Get a laugh at those meetings with this great funny mug for the office staff. ☕️ Your 15oz mug is crafted with Grade A ceramic. We design our mugs here in Edmonds WA. We press each one at about 380 degrees for several minutes. It's safe for dishwasher and microwave. The words will last for years. Which is good, because Zoom and Teams aren’t going away! And we need every bit of help to laugh our way through! It’s a great to show appreciation, and say thank you. ☕️ To see our unique collection of mugs, click on the \"Visit The Watermelon Heads Store.\" They're fun, funny, upbeat, quirky, and cool! It's like looking through a card store! See which ones feel right -- for you, and for the ones you love! Our mugs are copyrighted, original designs. They're dishwasher and microwave safe. Each design is pressed on at about 380 degrees for several minutes, so that you and the ones you love enjoy years of laughter, warm memories, motivation, and inspiration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710EyFfstKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERMELON HEADS","source_asin":"B09JLCR2XP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JLCR2XP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JLCR2XP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
