window.products.push({"id":603560,"name":"London UK - Westminster Abbey Church - Vintage Airline Travel Poster by David Klein c.1960s - Master Art Print 12in x 18in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t0PGunxML._AC_SL1008_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a taste of Aloha with these beautiful Master Art Prints by Pacifica Island Art - printed in Maui, Hawaii. This print will look wonderful framed in the home, office or restaurant and is perfect for the Vintage Art Collector. - ABOUT THE ARTIST - David Klein - David Klein (1918-2005) David Klein was an American artist, best known for his influential work in advertising. Klein was born in El Paso, Texas in 1918, but moved to California where he attended the Art Center School (later renamed Art Center College of Design) in Los Angeles. During the 1930s, he was a prominent member of the California Watercolor Society and displayed his work at various exhibits, most notably the Golden Gate International Exposition of 1939–40. Although he produced illustrations for Broadway theatrical productions, Hollywood films, the United States Army, and numerous corporate clients, Klein is best remembered for the iconic travel images he created for Howard Hughes and Trans World Airlines (TWA) during the 1950s and 1960s.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t0PGunxML._AC_SL1008_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacifica Island Art","source_asin":"B09SP9SD3D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SP9SD3D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SP9SD3D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":603561,"name":"Vintage Art Deco Coupe for Champagne, Martini, Cocktails, Glasses | Set of 6 | 7 oz Classic Cocktail Glassware - Manhattan, Cosmopolitan, Sidecar, Cry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714YcXAx-aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Offering a unique hand blown Italian style, these coupe champagne glasses are a stunning accent at any table. A collection of six brilliantly colored hand blown Coupe Glasses. These glasses are both stylish and practical for serving Martini's, champagne or cocktails. The attractive gold rim around each glass is not only an attractive design element, but also adds a bit of sophistication to any table setting. Whether you are entertaining or just serving your favorite cocktails, these gorgeous hand-blown glassware pieces make every occasion more special. This charming set of six glasses will infuse any gathering with an elevated sense of sophistication and grace. This set is a combination of art, heritage and craftsmanship. The grace of this coupe glass set will not go unnoticed. Fashioned from hand-blown, multi-colored glass, this set will add a splash of color and elegance to your table. A set of six mouthblown and handcut wine glasses in hues of Pink, Orange, Yellow, Green, Blue, and Purple. Each 7 oz glass is accented with a gold rim for added elegance. Colored glassware brings a modern touch to your home decor. Beautiful colors, detailed lines and a glossy finish make these glasses something to treasure. These beautiful hand-blown glasses with intricately cut details add a modern and elegant touch to your tableware. Add some color to your home decor with the exquisite Coupe Glasses. Each piece is mouthblown and handcut, with a modern colored glass design, bringing a fresh and elegant touch to any table setting. Use them for casual everyday use, or save for that special occasion. Perfect for champagne, and great for everyday use or entertaining, you will find endless uses for this multi-colored se. Perfect for entertaining or everyday, the gold rim and various colors are an absolute must have. Playing up the charming qualities of handblown glass, our elegant coupe glasses are mouth-blown to create unique hues. They’re finished with gold plating that lends a colorful and elegant touch to your favorite holiday beverages. Whether shopping for a wedding gift, hosting a dinner party or building your own barware collection, this elegant set of six Coupe Colored Glasses will make any occasion extra celebratory.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714YcXAx-aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Wine Savant","source_asin":"B0BZ6C1C5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ6C1C5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ6C1C5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
