window.products.push({"id":603599,"name":"Old World Christmas Hanging Tree Ornament, Narwhal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LXGp7R9NL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Swimming the icy waters of the Arctic Sea, narwhals are known for the long, thin tusk adorning their heads. The seemingly useless tusk is not used for hunting or fighting. Long ago narwhal sightings reinforced the belief of unicorns. Imagine stumbling upon a washed-up tusk on shore, thinking you'd found a unicorn horn. Old World Christmas is the premier brand of Christmas ornaments in the country. The founders, Tim and Beth Merck, a couple who shared a special love for Christmas, are credited with revitalizing the art of mouth-blown fine glass ornaments as a result of their reintroducing figural designs to the United States in 1979. Each figural glass ornament produced by Old World Christmas is hand crafted in age-old tradition using the same techniques that originated in the 1800's. Molten glass is mouth-blown into finely carved molds made exclusively for Old World Christmas, before a hot solution of liquid silver is poured inside. The ornaments are then hand-painted and glittered to achieve the beautiful creations. At Old World Christmas our goal is to offer the best in quality, design, and value. We promise to provide high-quality, traditionally designed, hand-crafted ornaments that are created with even more attention to detail than those produced 100 years ago. We are committed to excellent customer service, affordable prices, and fast, efficient shipping that is second-to-none. Package contains (1) Old World Christmas Hanging Tree Ornament, Narwhal. Size: 6 1/4 inches. Mouth blown into carved mold. Hand-painted and glittered in a series of labor-intensive steps to achieve the beautiful creations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LXGp7R9NL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Old World Christmas","source_asin":"B07FMCKZ4F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FMCKZ4F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FMCKZ4F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
