window.products.push({"id":603681,"name":"FRANZ PETER SCHUBERT STATUETTE Bust Figurine 5\" High","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21PzSodxtsL._AC_.jpg","description":"Franz Peter Schubert (January 31, 1797 November 19, 1828), was an Austrian composer, considered the last master of the Viennese Classical school and one of the earliest proponents of musical Romanticism. Although he died at the young age of 31, he wrote some six hundred romantic songs (lieder) as well as many symphonies, sonatas, string quartets, some operas and many other works. With a natural flair for melodies and lyricism, Schubert is counted among the most gifted composers of the 19th century.Halbe composer statuette stands approximately 5 - 5-1/2\" high and is made of the finest unbreakable vinyl plastic - it is strong, tough and washable. This statuette would make a great gift for a Schubert enthusiast or for yourself! Also excellent for use as Music Teacher Awards, Gifts for Music Students, Music Studio Promotions, Homes, Schools and Colleges.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21PzSodxtsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dugan","source_asin":"B000M6QN9O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000M6QN9O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000M6QN9O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
