window.products.push({"id":603695,"name":"Wildkin Two Compartment Insulated Lunch Bag for Boys & Girls, Perfect for Early Elementary Lunch Box Bag, Ideal Size for Packing Hot or Cold Snacks fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91m3W4+bjaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GROW UP WITH US: Wildkin, a household name in children's products, is a small business proudly based in Nashville, Tennessee. We offer fantastic backpacks, lunch boxes, sleeping bags, bedding, and more for toddlers, kids, and teens! Your kids will love our designs and you'll love our quality and pricing! We make useful, fun, and safe gear for kids. We offer excellent quality non-toxic products with coordinating accessories that you can mix and match. Our high-quality and unique bedding lines include items like comforter sets, sheet sets, pillow options, all for boys and girls. Decorating your kid’s room, no problem, we also offer clocks, furniture, and rugs. PRODUCT FUNCTIONALITY AND SAFETY: These kids lunch bags for school insulated have two compartments, top one with a zippered front opening for quick and easy access making the lunch bags for teens girls and boys perfect for drinks. The Wildkin’s lunch bag for kids girl and boy is perfect for the on-the-go parent or child. This lunch bag for kids boys and girls will last a long time, but you’ll find that with all of Wildkin’s kids lunch bags fun color and pattern options you’ll be ordering whenever you’re in the mood for a new look. The interior of each large lunch bag for kids is black which is easy to clean and doesn’t show stains. These lunch bags for teens girls and boys are excellent gift ideas for any event like Friendship Day, Independence Day, Mother's Day, Grandparent's Day, Parent's Day, New Year's Day, Valentine's Day, Halloween, Thanksgiving, and Christmas Day. 90 DAYS WARRANTY AGAINST DEFECTS: We aim for a happy customer experience! All of our lunch boxes for kids products feature a 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects - normal wear-and-tear, and misuse excluded. Rigorously tested to ensure that all parts and materials conform to rules and regulations set forth by the Consumer Products Safety Commission. Click “Add to Cart” now and let your little ones experience convenience and comfort with our Wildkin lunch bag insulated Products!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91m3W4+bjaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wildkin","source_asin":"B08WDHT8XL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WDHT8XL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WDHT8XL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
