window.products.push({"id":603742,"name":"KAF Home Popcorn Terry, Set of 4 Bar Mop Kitchen Towels, Drizzle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J1EtLlENL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Popcorn Terry Bar Mop Towels, by KAF Home, are super absorbent, hard working, versatile and soft to the touch. These will quickly become your go-to towel for drying dishes and hands; also perfect for cleaning up in commercial or home kitchens, bathroom, garage, R.V. or on the boat. Sold as a set of 4, so you are never without a clean one for the next task at hand. Generous sizing with each towel measuring 16 x 19 inches. 100% Cotton, they are easy to care for: machine wash and tumble dry. For best results, wash before first use, with like colors. As with most natural fibers, some shrinkage may occur during first washing","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J1EtLlENL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAF Home","source_asin":"B07G7BLDTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G7BLDTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G7BLDTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
