window.products.push({"id":603753,"name":"Air Purifier for Home/Office, CADR 250m³/h, Afloia Air Cleaner H13 HEPA Filtration removes 99.97% Air Contaminants, 3-Stage Filter for Pet Dander/Odor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZIUzxvvfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌞1.【Efficient air purifier】With CADR rating of 250m³/h, air purifier for home circulates air quickly in a room up to 220ft² (20m²) to fill your room with clean and fresh air. 100% Ozone-free and CARB Certified air purifier, available for California. Compliant with California's stringent standards for indoor air cleaning devices. 🌞2.【Almighty protector】No air pollutants bypass the 3-layer filter. Pre-filter captures large particles such as dust and pet hair; True HEPA 13 filter captures 99.97% of pollutants such as allergens, mold spores, dust mites, and pet dander; Activated carbon filter removes common odors caused by smoke, pets, cooking, dorm room smells and gases (VOCs) as well as smoke caused by wildfires. 🌞3.【Guardian of security】Unlike other air purifiers, it has no accessible blades, so it's safer for kids' small hands. Through the lightning test, even if a large amount of current passes in a short time, it can ensure that the air purifier is normal. 🌞4.【Quiet companion】3 kinds of adjustable fan speed, two kinds of adjustable night light brightness. The lowest operating noise of the air purifier is only 28db, and the night light can also be individually turned on or off. Create a peaceful and comfortable environment without affecting your study, work, or sleep. 🌞5.【Environmentalist】Air purifier working power is only 35 watts and its daily power consumption is less than 0.84 kW·h. Air purifier supports the setting of 2/4/8 hours to turn off regularly to meet the air purification needs with minimal energy consumption. [important]When the lamp ring flashes in red, it means the filter to be changed. We recommend replacing the filter every 3-6 months (Afloia true HEPA filter ASIN: B08FD3NBMN)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZIUzxvvfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Afloia","source_asin":"B094JH53NF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094JH53NF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094JH53NF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
