window.products.push({"id":603759,"name":"Nordic Ware 14\" Flat Bottom Authentic Aluminized Steel Wok with Silicone Handle Grips","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41t9ttPNUiL._AC_.jpg","description":"Nordic Ware's Superior Steel Wok is spun out of aluminized steel. Through the manufacturing process, the metal compresses creating the spun look while producing a durable, heavy weight wok. Aluminized steel is a combination of steel and aluminum, steel is the core metal with aluminum on both sides. Steel retains the heat and the aluminum disperses the heat evenly as well as preventing rusting and providing superior heat distribution. Wok cooking requires high heat on the bottom of the unit for quick stir frying and aluminized steel is deal for this. The aluminum also allows the ability to coat the exterior and interior with a durable, long lasting coating not found with woks that are made strictly from steel. Nordic Ware uses a 3-step process for the interior nonstick coating. Certified by NSF International, the widely recognized and respected independent certification organization for public health safety. In becoming listed with NSF, Nordic Ware is recognized as having met the highest standards for materials and design, as well as for safety and cleaning. Every product is thoroughly reviewed to meet exacting NSF requirements that go beyond FDA food safety guidelines. In accomodating these standards Nordic Ware employs NSF to regularly audit facilities and processes to ensure the best practices are employed in the production of their many products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41t9ttPNUiL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nordic Ware","source_asin":"B004I4SI3A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004I4SI3A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004I4SI3A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":603760,"name":"Wine Bottle Labels for Bridal Shower Gift, Wedding Gift, Wedding milestones, Wedding Firsts (Same Sex Couples)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c0j48TPDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Whether as a bridal shower gift, engagement gift, or wedding gift these milestone marriage wine labels are the perfect way to celebrate the happy couple. Toast to the beaming couple with these perfectly coordinating bridal shower/engagement labels. Easy to apply and oh-so-stunning they're sure to be a hit that everyone is talking about. Item Details: -Set of 4 Milestone Wine Labels First Fight First Holiday First Big Purchase First Anniversary -Label size is 4\"x5\" -Printed on a white film stock making it easy to apply to most standard wine bottles -Wine shown in photos not included Application suggestions: -Completley remove wine label from bottle you purchase -Ensure surface is clean and dry -Remove Wedding Milestone Label from liner -Starting on one end, align your wine label accordingly and press firmly on the edge. Smoth out label slowly as you apply, minimizing bubbles -Tip: Remove the back label of the wine you purchase (instead of the front label) and place new bridal shower wine label here. This allows you to still remember which wine is which!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c0j48TPDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SBLABELS","source_asin":"B078BXC2PB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078BXC2PB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078BXC2PB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
