window.products.push({"id":603804,"name":"Kitch’nMore [38oz 30Pack Plastic Meal Prep Containers, 2 Compartment with Lids, Food Storage Container, Bento Box, Stackable, Microwave/Freezer/Dishwa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KgaPihBDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you want to get started on meal prepping? Not everyone has enough time to cook delicious and healthy feasts every day. This is why meal prepping has proved to be a worthwhile effort. Whether you're preparing meals for a family in the morning or looking for ways to eat healthy despite your busy schedule, there's no denying that making your meals ahead saves you time (and money!). Unfortunately, it can be difficult to get started without the right containers. Sometimes, prepping your meals can require very specific storage conditions. The good news is, our bundle is just what you need to get started on prepping meals for a healthier you. Indulge in healthy home-cooked meals no matter how busy you are with the Kitch’nMore Plastic Meal Prep Containers with Lids. Whatever diet plan you’re on, it's important to never run out of containers for storing your meal-prepped food. Our bundle includes 30 meal prep tubs — enough to serve families for weeks or for planning your own food for the next several weeks! Each food container is engineered with your safety in mind. Fitted with tight, leak-proof lids, you won't have to worry about your food spoiling in the fridge or freezer when stored over long stretches of time. You also don’t have to worry about messy spills! Designed for convenience, these containers are also microwave-friendly. That means you won't have to transfer your food into a different container to heat it up. Just remove the lid, pop it into the microwave, and your food is ready in a jiffy! Here are more reasons to meal prep using our containers: ✅ Clear lid for easy identification ✅ Lightweight and stackable ✅ Available in single or dual-compartment variants It’s time to meal prep like a pro. Add the Kitch’nMore Plastic Meal Prep Containers with Lids to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KgaPihBDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitch’nMore","source_asin":"B09HFCYXTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603804","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HFCYXTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HFCYXTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
