window.products.push({"id":603984,"name":"Bean Bag Chair Cover Only (No Filler) - Extra Large, Stuffed Animal Storage & Memory Foam - Washable Premium Soft Corduroy, Sturdy Zipper Beanbag Case","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WAN5SebXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"* MACHINE WASHABLE & ZIPPER DESIGN: Our beanbag chair cover can go through the washer & dryer without any issues. Extra-large zipper openings with heavy-duty zippers allow easy access for stuffing toys, stuffed animals, blankets, and pillows. It also has a convenient handle, ease of pulling around. 【Zipper Length of Opening: Small - Semicircular opening, 21.65inch; Medium - 19.69inch; Extra Large - 23.62inch】 * PREMIUM QUALITY: Made of high-quality corduroy fabric, skin-friendly, soft & comfortable, abrasion-resistant, and breathable. This fabric of our bean bag chair cover has been carefully selected for its quality and usability, machine washable, and is flat stitched for extra strength and durability. * GREAT STORAGE SOLUTION: What a great way to store stuffed animals! Your kids must love them! You can use the bean bag cover to store blankets, old clothes, plush toys, etc. It's a great small storage solution for you, making your room so clean. * CREATING A COMFY BEAN BAG CHAIR: Creating a soft, comfy chair after stuffing, ideal for sitting on it and reading a book. If you don’t have enough stuffed animals, you can fill the bean bag cover with old pillows, blankets, and anything else taking up closet space. It's a perfect choice for living rooms, playrooms, bedrooms, and dens. * THREE SIZES AVAILABLE: Small - 28x32inches, Medium - 35x43inches, Large - 47x47inches. How many beans can it hold? Small - 62.58L, Medium - 134.5 L, Extra Large - 210.11L. (Bean Bag Cover Only, No Filler) Please pay attention to the product information; please do not buy it by mistake. We have been focusing on improving product quality and service standards. If you have any issues with our Bean Bag Inner Liner, please feel free to contact us and resolve the issues for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WAN5SebXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"gootrades","source_asin":"B08X9YFLKQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X9YFLKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X9YFLKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":603985,"name":"Simple Deluxe Sage Green Bath or Kitchen Mat, Memory Foam Rug, Non Slip Backing, Washable, Absorbent Alfombras para Baños","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91B3x-gtRWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester Imported COMFORTABLE AND LUXURIOUS – Simple Deluxe bath rugs / mat are filled with soft and comfortable memory foam and the outer material is very soft with a cozy velvety microfiber. Never have you been able to step right out of the bath or shower onto a cloud! Great for bathroom, vanity, vacation home, master bathroom, kids bathroom, bed or guest suite. Great gift idea for all occasions, Christmas, Wedding, Fathers Day, Mothers Day, Valentines. SUPER ABSORBENT– The Simple Deluxe bathmat is much more absorbent than cotton bath rugs. Microfiber drinks the water, helping to save your floors from slippery floors while you're stepping out of the bath, shower, or using the sink. Moisture is trapped in the mat's foam core, allowing the rug to dry quickly and cleanly. MACHINE WASHABLE - Machine wash in cold water with mild detergent. Do not use chlorine or bleach. Tumble dry on low heat or lay flat to air dry. Colorfast will not fade and stay vibrant for years to come NON SLIP - Simple Deluxe Bath Mat Rug Runners are backed with PVC to prevent slipping, shifting and skidding. The backing ensures the rug will hold up after many washes. (Do not place mat on wet surface. Make sure floors are clean and dry beneath the rug to prevent it from slipping.) GOOD IN ANY ROOM – Simple Deluxe elegant bath mats rugs can be used at tub-side, front of the sink, or at any place in your home where you want support and warmth on your toes! And from a design viewpoint, this rug can make a significant difference in the overall color scheme of your bathroom scheme or coordinate with towels and other bathroom décor or accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91B3x-gtRWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simple Deluxe","source_asin":"B00H3UDBLA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-603985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H3UDBLA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H3UDBLA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
